{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04FF60","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"让机器像人类一样思考真的有必要吗？在决定是否报复时，共情能力反而会碍事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"确实，冷酷的判断或许和人性化的思考无法兼容。可如果这样，所谓“非人类的思考”又是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"当<R=电子计算机,COMPUTER>发展到计算速度超过人类时，人们开始描绘一个梦想。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=电子计算机,COMPUTER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"梦想？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"既然能进行那么高级的计算，也许机器同样能够拥有与人类相当的智能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"19世纪作家Villiers de l'Isle-Adam在《未来的夏娃》中，描写了主人公创造人造人作为理想恋人的故事……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":136,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"亲手创造出拥有智能的存在，或许一直都是人类长久以来的梦想。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这么说，AI的起点就是人类的梦想。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不只是AI。文明本身，就是人类不断把梦想变为现实的过程。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"但梦想也会变成噩梦。人们同样畏惧“非人类的智能”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"人类还真是任性。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"就像捷克作家Karel Čapek在《罗素姆万能机器人》中描写的那样，人们也害怕拥有智能的机器人反过来反抗人类。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"1970年的电影《巨人：福宾计划》中，也描写了美苏两国拥有智能的计算机联手，企图统治人类的故事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":136,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"可以说，Isaac Asimov提出的机器人三定律，正是针对这种恐惧给出的具体解决方案。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"它说明，机器人的智能虽然与人类不同，但双方仍然可以共存。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"要把智能装进计算机里，就必须深入理解“智能”究竟是什么。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"在这种情况下，既有实现可能、现实中又确实需要的，就是专家系统。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""}]}